prob('GP-1982-43','Automorphy of the H1 of arbitrary curves',r'Associate suitable algebraic automorphic data to the compatible \(H^1\) Galois representations of arbitrary smooth projective curves over \(\mathbb Q\), matching local Euler factors and completions.',['1982-595.6'],r'November 2026: general actual automorphy remains open. Potential automorphy is known for genus-two curves over totally real fields; the 2025 actual modularity theorem proves a specified residual-surjective ordinary genus-two class over \(\mathbb Q\).',[BG,BM,GE])
